  "content": "I'll pull rounds since September 1 with their three-putt counts.The three-putt rows are a career cache, so I'll join them to the rounds dated since September 1.Two rounds since September 1 had three or more three-putts, and both are Cole Bennett's, from the October 21 tournament at Springfield Country Club.\n\n- **Round scoring 74:** 37 putts and 3 three-putts.\n- **Round scoring 77:** 37 putts and 3 three-putts.\n\nBoth were 18-hole tournament rounds, and both were posted on the same day, so they are separate rounds. I checked 26 rounds dated since September 1. That total includes 3 in-progress practice rounds with no stat line, and the qualifier rounds of September 25 and 26 have no putting data recorded. A three-putt round among those could not show up here, so this list may be incomplete.\n\nThe other 23 rounds with three or more three-putts in the stat lines all fall before September 1.",
